The first oracle response is still pending; the harness is enforcing a hard wall-clock deadline, so a slow or hung provider will be redrawn rather than counted as a failure. Meanwhile, the shipped witness remains only two integers (20 characters worst case in a 1,000-seed sweep), so escalation grows the coefficient/radius haystack without approaching the answer cap.
